WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.460
No one, especially the President, is above the law.

00:00:07.040 --> 00:00:09.180
No one is above the law.

00:00:17.320 --> 00:00:19.400
Nobody is above the law.

00:00:19.400 --> 00:00:28.900
No one is above the law.

00:00:28.900 --> 00:00:30.400
No one is above the law.

00:00:30.500 --> 00:00:31.600
No one is above the law.

00:00:31.940 --> 00:00:34.100
No one is above the law.

00:00:34.240 --> 00:00:35.180
Oh, son of a bitch.

00:00:50.620 --> 00:00:54.000
Young man, there's no need to feel down.

00:00:54.120 --> 00:00:57.720
I said, young man, hit yourself off the ground.

00:00:57.720 --> 00:01:01.440
I said, young man, cause you're in a new town.

00:01:01.640 --> 00:01:05.540
There's no need to be unhappy.

00:01:06.020 --> 00:01:08.880
Young man, there's a place you can go.

00:01:09.160 --> 00:01:14.240
I said, young man, when you're short on your dough, you can stay there.

00:01:14.920 --> 00:01:21.040
And I'm sure you will find many ways to have a good time.
